#org @gText_PilotNameRater_Intro
Hello, hello!\nI rate POKEMON nicknames.\pWould you like me to look at one?

#org @gText_PilotNameRater_WhichMon
Which POKEMON's nickname should\nI rate?

#org @gText_PilotNameRater_RenameAsk
{STR_VAR_1}, is it?\nThat is a fine nickname.\pWould you like to choose a new\none?

#org @gText_PilotNameRater_NewName
What shall the new nickname be?

#org @gText_PilotNameRater_Renamed
Done! From now on, this POKEMON\nshall be known as {STR_VAR_1}!

#org @gText_PilotNameRater_SameName
Done! {STR_VAR_1} looks the same,\nbut a familiar name can be best.

#org @gText_PilotNameRater_Egg
Now, now.\nThat is merely an EGG!

#org @gText_PilotNameRater_NotYours
{STR_VAR_1}, is it?\nThat name already suits it well.\pPlease take good care of\n{STR_VAR_1}!

#org @gText_PilotNameRater_Goodbye
I see.\nDo come visit again.
